#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-sys-d.md:1
msgid "战斗系统的设计想法"
msgstr "Battle System Design Ideas"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-sys-d.md:3
msgid "作者"
msgstr "Author"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-sys-d.md:4
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;BackSlzeep"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;BackSlzeep"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-sys-d.md:7
msgid "战斗形式"
msgstr "Battle Format"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-sys-d.md:9
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;主要形式：横板动作，两面受敌，背对背与游戏AI合作。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;画面的中心为辅助机，往两边展开维生立场，两名角色对称地处于辅助机两边战斗。（避免人物重叠的一种方案，缺点：手机端操作视野不佳，小屏幕读取动作信息不便）角色可以相互背对背靠拢回复状态，进攻时各自维持自己这边的战线。"
"   &emsp;&emsp;画面根据距离会在一定程度上缩放。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;Main format: Side-scrolling action, enemies on both sides, "
"back-to-back cooperation with game AI.   &emsp;&emsp;The center of the "
"screen is the support unit, deploying a life-sustaining field outward on "
"both sides. Two characters fight symmetrically on each side of the "
"support unit. (A solution to avoid character overlap; drawback: poor "
"field of view on mobile, difficult to read action info on small screens.)"
" Characters can move back-to-back to recover their status, and each "
"maintains their own front line when attacking.   &emsp;&emsp;The screen "
"scales to some degree based on distance."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-sys-d.md:13
msgid "辅助机系统"
msgstr "Support Unit System"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-sys-d.md:15
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;辅助机：地面行动必须携带的弱智能机器，有多种型号。辅助机会受到特定的怪物破坏，保持这些怪物远离辅助机。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;维生立场：由辅助机展开，以保证人物免于地面的高温和辐射，展开范围为辅助机两边最远人物之间（辅助机永远处于中间位置），在辅助机位置可以缓慢恢复生命。"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;金粉：辅助机展开卫生立场必要的物资，在维生立场展开时会以一定的速率消耗，在两个人物相距过远时会加速消耗。怪物掉落、特定区域采集。（要求保证一定的击杀效率）"
"   &emsp;&emsp;采集：辅助机/人物经过即自动采集"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;Support Unit: A weakly intelligent machine required for "
"ground operations, available in multiple models. The support unit can be "
"destroyed by specific monsters — keep these monsters away from it.   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Life-Sustaining Field: Deployed by the support unit to "
"protect characters from ground heat and radiation. The field extends "
"between the farthest characters on each side (the support unit is always "
"in the center). Characters can slowly recover health at the support "
"unit's position.   &emsp;&emsp;Gold Dust: A necessary resource for the "
"support unit to deploy the life-sustaining field. It is consumed at a "
"constant rate while the field is active, and consumption accelerates when"
" the two characters are too far apart. Dropped by monsters or gathered in"
" specific areas. (Requires maintaining a certain kill efficiency.)   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Collection: Automatically collected when the support "
"unit/characters pass over resources"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-sys-d.md:20
msgid "人物系统"
msgstr "Character System"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-sys-d.md:22
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;人数：进入游戏的角色可以达三个或四个（包括我在内），战斗时只能有两个角色。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;数值：人物数值仅仅与“缺陷词条”有相关的成长。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;Number of Characters: Up to three or four characters can "
"enter the game (including the player), but only two characters can "
"participate in battle at a time.   &emsp;&emsp;Stats: Character stats "
"only grow in relation to \"Defect Traits.\""

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-sys-d.md:25
msgid "位置系统"
msgstr "Position System"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-sys-d.md:27
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;靠拢/撤退键：短按两边同时短距离靠拢（让另一边规避伤害/控制维生立场的范围），长按快速靠拢到辅助机（恢复状态）   "
"&emsp;&emsp;交换键：短按更换当前操作的角色，长按快速换边   &emsp;&emsp;进攻键：各自快速抵达最近的怪物身边"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;Close-in/Retreat Button: Tap to close in a short distance on "
"both sides simultaneously (to let the other side avoid damage / control "
"the life-sustaining field range); hold to quickly close in to the support"
" unit (to recover status).   &emsp;&emsp;Switch Button: Tap to switch the"
" currently controlled character; hold to quickly switch sides.   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Attack Button: Each character quickly reaches the nearest "
"monster."

